<title>GREECE: GREEK JUNE BUILDING MATERIALS PRICE INDEX UP 6.5PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK JUNE BUILDING MATERIALS PRICE INDEX UP 6.5PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's building materilas price</p>
<p>index for new housing rose 6.5 percent year-on-year in June from</p>
<p>6.6 percent in May, the National Statistics Service (NSS) said</p>
<p>in a statement.</p>
<p>The index was up an average 6.7 percent in the first-half of</p>
<p>the year compared to 7.5 percent and 7.3 percent in the same</p>
<p>period in 1996 and 1995 respectively, it said.</p>
<p>					 June 97     May 97     June 96</p>
<p>    Month-month change (pct)     0.0	  0.6	   0.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year(pct)		6.5	  6.6	   7.2</p>
<p>    Index (1990=100)		 196.6     196.6	  184.6</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
